---
import DocsLayout from '../../components/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Security & Sanitization">
  <article class="mth-prose">
    <h1>Security &amp; Sanitization (<code>@methane/sanitize</code>)</h1>
    <p>
      Every rich text, Markdown, and AI streaming surface in Methane sanitizes untrusted HTML
      through <code>@methane/sanitize</code>. Raw <code>innerHTML</code> and Lit
      <code>unsafeHTML</code> outside <code>@methane/sanitize</code> are statically banned by
      <code>@methane/lint-plugin</code>.
    </p>

    <h2>Defense-in-Depth Rules</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Native Sanitizer API + DOMPurify Parity:</strong> Feature-detects
        <code>'setHTML' in Element.prototype</code> and falls back to bundled DOMPurify configured
        for strict native parity (<code>ALLOW_ARIA_ATTR: false</code>,
        <code>ALLOW_DATA_ATTR: false</code>, <code>KEEP_CONTENT: false</code>,
        <code>RETURN_TRUSTED_TYPE: true</code> under Trusted Types CSP).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Zero <code>innerHTML</code> Re-Serialization:</strong> Parsed fragments move directly
        into the DOM without round-tripping strings.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>URL Allowlist (<code>isSafeUrl</code>):</strong> Allows only <code>https:</code>,
        <code>http:</code>, <code>mailto:</code>, <code>tel:</code>, and relative <code>/</code> or
        <code>#</code> paths; rejects <code>javascript:</code>, <code>data:</code>, and
        <code>vbscript:</code>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>User SVGs &amp; Uploads:</strong> Uploaded SVGs render exclusively via
        <code>&lt;img src&gt;</code> (never inline <code>&lt;svg&gt;</code>). Client-side upload
        MIME/size checks are advisory UX checks only; server-side validation is mandatory.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <pre><code>{`import { safeSetHTML, parseSafeFragment, isSafeUrl } from '@methane/sanitize';

safeSetHTML(containerEl, untrustedHtml);`}</code></pre>
  </article>
</DocsLayout>
